<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Etec started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Etec started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said Thursday it had started coverage of Etec Systems Inc with a rating of accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the mask generation equipment company opened Thursday up 3/4 at 52-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
